Sugrīva questions panicked army --- Aṅgada shows fallen Rāma Lakṣmaṇa --- Vibhīṣaṇa joins Sugrīva amid rout --- Jāmbavān rallies fleeing monkeys --- Vibhīṣaṇa laments ruined hopes --- Sugrīva promises kingdom and plans rescue --- Suṣeṇa sends Hanumān for healing herbs --- Garuḍa arrives and scatters snake arrows --- Garuḍa heals brothers, owns friendship and warns --- Garuḍa departs as monkeys storm gates